+
+The auditor never changes campaign artifacts.  On success it emits one JSON
+document to stdout; on failure it exits non-zero and writes the reason to
+stderr.  Validation reports already bind every raw and HF file by SHA256.
+Passing ``--verify-hf-hashes`` additionally re-hashes the current full HF
+trees.  Passing ``--verify-all-hashes`` verifies every raw/HF/Hessian tensor
+and FP-reference cache file; that mode can be substantially more expensive.
+"""
